{"id":242170,"bangumiId":242170,"type":2,"name":"オーバーロードⅢ","name_cn":"OVERLORD 第三季","date":"2018-07-10","year":"2018","region":"jp","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/47/d4/242170_iz9Ko.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/47/d4/242170_iz9Ko.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/47/d4/242170_iz9Ko.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/47/d4/242170_iz9Ko.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/47/d4/242170_iz9Ko.jpg"},"summary":"时间为2138年。曾卷起一大风潮的虚拟现实体感型网络游戏《YGGDRASIL》即将迎来停服。玩家飞鼠在曾经以同伴和荣华自傲的根据地纳萨力克地下大坟墓，独自一人安静等待着那一刻。但是，不料发生了“过了结束时间却还没有登出”的异常事态。NPC们开始以自己的意志行动，不止如此，纳萨力克之外展开了从未见过的异世界。飞鼠为了寻找过去的同伴，以公会名安兹·乌尔·恭自称，决定在异世界扬名立万。他与宣誓绝对忠诚的部下一同，向新的地域进军。","rating":{"rank":5958,"total":9920,"count":{"1":81,"2":53,"3":114,"4":345,"5":1097,"6":3479,"7":3308,"8":1082,"9":165,"10":196},"score":6.4},"collection":{"on_hold":219,"dropped":285,"wish":686,"collect":19242,"doing":473},"tags":[{"name":"MADHouse","count":1443,"total_count":112947},{"name":"轻小说改","count":1364,"total_count":512838},{"name":"2018年7月","count":1260,"total_count":26611},{"name":"骨傲天","count":1195,"total_count":5908},{"name":"异世界","count":1156,"total_count":276946},{"name":"穿越","count":1147,"total_count":66526},{"name":"TV","count":960,"total_count":1456718},{"name":"奇幻","count":957,"total_count":497927},{"name":"OVERLORD","count":648,"total_count":3684},{"name":"装逼","count":547,"total_count":9447},{"name":"轻改","count":545,"total_count":157118},{"name":"龙傲天","count":541,"total_count":41084},{"name":"2018","count":477,"total_count":79834},{"name":"战斗","count":255,"total_count":495580},{"name":"网游","count":255,"total_count":14556},{"name":"小说改","count":190,"total_count":170091},{"name":"日本","count":121,"total_count":320608},{"name":"第三季","count":96,"total_count":1591},{"name":"续作","count":59,"total_count":48966},{"name":"伊藤尚往","count":58,"total_count":553},{"name":"搞笑","count":41,"total_count":662841},{"name":"后宫","count":30,"total_co